Description: file manager and graphical shell for Cinnamon
 Nolphin is a file manager for the Cinnamon desktop, based on Nemo. It allows
 to browse directories, preview files and launch applications associated
 with them. It is also responsible for handling the icons on the Cinnamon
 desktop. It works on local and remote filesystems.
 .
 This single package contains the program, its data files and translations,
 the libnolphin-extension runtime library and its GObject introspection
 data. It is built for Linux Mint.
